1
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:12,625
Five packs of Seven Stars.

2
00:00:12,708 --> 00:00:15,375
-That one we don't have.
-Then give me ten packs.

3
00:00:15,916 --> 00:00:18,291
-Seven packs okay?
-Two packs are enough.

4
00:00:20,875 --> 00:00:22,000
Hey.

5
00:00:24,791 --> 00:00:27,083
Hey, stop!

6
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:32,458
If you didn't steal anything,
then what's the hurry?

7
00:00:32,541 --> 00:00:34,208
I don't know what your problem is.

8
00:00:34,291 --> 00:00:35,625
If you falsely accuse me, I can--

9
00:00:35,708 --> 00:00:37,875
You look crooked. I've been watching you.

10
00:00:38,375 --> 00:00:40,125
Aunt, I saw what he did.

11
00:00:40,625 --> 00:00:43,791
Can't you see I'm busy? Go watch the door.

12
00:00:45,208 --> 00:00:46,333
What?

13
00:00:49,083 --> 00:00:50,916
He only had 200 on him.

14
00:00:54,875 --> 00:00:57,708
What are you staring at?
You can't even guard a door.

15
00:00:57,791 --> 00:00:59,125
Money sink.

16
00:01:00,125 --> 00:01:02,791
If your mother hadn't died so young,
I'd be free of you.

17
00:01:02,875 --> 00:01:05,625
I'm sick of looking at that sad face.

18
00:01:12,708 --> 00:01:13,708
Hey.

19
00:01:15,166 --> 00:01:17,583
No need to wait till closing
to come back for it.

20
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:23,208
I took three grand as commission.

21
00:01:36,125 --> 00:01:38,708
Where are you?
Why aren't you guarding the door?

22
00:01:39,208 --> 00:01:42,375
I went to buy food. I thought you wanted
something for your lover.

23
00:01:42,458 --> 00:01:44,458
You got a death wish? Watch that mouth.

24
00:01:44,958 --> 00:01:46,166
Get back here.

25
00:02:48,958 --> 00:02:50,958
Make a sound and you're dead.

26
00:03:16,083 --> 00:03:18,250
THE FIXERS

27
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:22,916
DOG EAT DOG

28
00:03:49,041 --> 00:03:50,541
Madam Fan's expecting me.

29
00:04:04,541 --> 00:04:06,333
Dead or disappeared.

30
00:04:07,166 --> 00:04:09,000
The client doesn't care.

31
00:04:09,958 --> 00:04:12,291
Just as long as it's taken care of.

32
00:04:12,375 --> 00:04:13,583
Okay.

33
00:04:19,833 --> 00:04:21,208
Madam Fan.

34
00:04:24,791 --> 00:04:28,291
I heard you had one old
and one young competitor.

35
00:04:28,375 --> 00:04:31,291
It's true. We share the same objective.

36
00:04:33,333 --> 00:04:37,458
Maybe there was a problem
on the client's end. I'll handle it.

37
00:04:39,250 --> 00:04:41,708
During it all,
something of mine was taken.

38
00:04:42,875 --> 00:04:44,125
I'd like it back.

39
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,916
This necklace. Who is it from?

40
00:04:59,958 --> 00:05:03,291
I've never seen you without it.
Where did you get it?

41
00:05:05,291 --> 00:05:07,583
It's sort of an ancestral heirloom.

42
00:05:10,625 --> 00:05:11,458
Hmm.

43
00:05:12,083 --> 00:05:13,916
Then you should have it returned.

44
00:05:16,958 --> 00:05:18,416
Go back home first.

45
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:19,541
For this case,

46
00:05:19,625 --> 00:05:21,875
wait to hear from me before you proceed.

47
00:05:21,958 --> 00:05:22,875
Uh-huh.

48
00:06:13,958 --> 00:06:15,041
Hey, Tai.

49
00:06:24,833 --> 00:06:27,958
Tai, the director generals
made their choice.

50
00:06:43,583 --> 00:06:47,708
X: DID YOU DELETE
ALL THE VIDEOS ON YOUR END?

51
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,750
And now to a tragedy
that shocked the entertainment world.

52
00:06:54,833 --> 00:06:56,750
An explicit video of Sheng…

53
00:06:56,833 --> 00:06:58,375
FIXER GOLD

54
00:06:58,458 --> 00:06:59,750
Oh, shut up.

55
00:07:01,375 --> 00:07:03,833
Sweet and sour pork ribs again.

56
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:08,791
I thought I told you to call.
Don't just arrive at the office. Get it?

57
00:07:09,375 --> 00:07:10,750
I did, but you didn't answer.

58
00:07:10,833 --> 00:07:13,333
Look, man, I'm a poor dad
just trying to make a living.

59
00:07:13,416 --> 00:07:15,416
Uh, why are we talking to four-eyes?

60
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:16,833
I don't have to listen to you.

61
00:07:16,916 --> 00:07:19,833
I've got presbyopia.
Wear glasses or your eyes will go bad.

62
00:07:19,916 --> 00:07:22,083
There are some scumbags
I need you to look up.

63
00:07:22,166 --> 00:07:24,791
Can't you wait for me to pick up my kids
and go home first?

64
00:07:24,875 --> 00:07:27,041
This isn't something you do
when you finish your chores.

65
00:07:27,125 --> 00:07:29,166
The chairman wants this case closed
by tomorrow.

66
00:07:29,250 --> 00:07:30,750
Oh, that's tough.

67
00:07:30,833 --> 00:07:32,208
-I want 40%.
-You're joking.

68
00:07:32,291 --> 00:07:35,333
-It's a rip-off.
-Mister, I'm raising a kid.

69
00:07:35,416 --> 00:07:37,250
I… I gotta have eye surgery.

70
00:07:37,333 --> 00:07:39,291
-40%.
-Hey, hey, hey.

71
00:07:39,375 --> 00:07:41,166
So what? You got a kid. I got a kid.

72
00:07:41,250 --> 00:07:44,625
We all gotta make do.
You. It comes out of your cut.

73
00:07:44,708 --> 00:07:47,083
I want you to look into
this Emperor Tai's account.

74
00:07:47,166 --> 00:07:50,000
Sheng messaged him
to see if the videos had been deleted,

75
00:07:50,083 --> 00:07:52,333
which means
he's got Sheng's video selfies.

76
00:07:52,416 --> 00:07:53,875
He could be the one who leaked them.

77
00:07:54,875 --> 00:07:57,333
Oh, okay.

78
00:07:58,208 --> 00:08:00,083
My manager needs me back coding.

79
00:08:00,166 --> 00:08:02,083
Hey, can you clean up?

80
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,000
If I find him, I'll call.

81
00:08:06,583 --> 00:08:08,958
If you clean up, I'll pay the 40%.

82
00:08:09,041 --> 00:08:11,625
Fuck, I don't believe this guy's broke.

83
00:08:11,708 --> 00:08:14,458
He got a drink, and he didn't drink it.
That's poverty, all right.

84
00:08:20,291 --> 00:08:21,750
Psst, hey.

85
00:08:31,541 --> 00:08:33,041
I got a couple of questions.

86
00:08:33,125 --> 00:08:36,583
You have so many. Yeah?

87
00:08:36,666 --> 00:08:40,166
So we've already deleted
Ms. Yen's daughter's videos.

88
00:08:40,250 --> 00:08:42,000
So why are we still investigating?

89
00:08:42,083 --> 00:08:46,083
Sheng's videos went online,
so we have to find the source of the leak.

90
00:08:46,583 --> 00:08:47,958
Okay, all right.

91
00:08:48,041 --> 00:08:49,833
Show this scumbag a good lesson.

92
00:08:51,416 --> 00:08:53,250
Hmm…

93
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:57,125
We're not gonna get results too quickly
from four-eyes, are we?

94
00:08:57,833 --> 00:09:00,625
Stealth does
the temple's best intelligence reporting.

95
00:09:01,291 --> 00:09:03,791
Hey. You're thinking of
slacking off already?

96
00:09:03,875 --> 00:09:05,291
What, me? No.

97
00:09:06,125 --> 00:09:09,583
It's just that my…
my son just finished his midterms,

98
00:09:09,666 --> 00:09:11,916
and I promised to take him out
for a nice meal.

99
00:09:12,583 --> 00:09:14,583
That's okay.
We'll have a meal another day.

100
00:09:14,666 --> 00:09:16,166
All right, where are we going?

101
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:20,333
Look, he probably won't get onto it
straight away.

102
00:09:20,833 --> 00:09:21,791
You go ahead.

103
00:09:21,875 --> 00:09:22,791
What?

104
00:09:23,291 --> 00:09:24,916
Are you fucking with me now?

105
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,708
Hey, it won't be that easy
to lose me, all right?

106
00:09:27,791 --> 00:09:29,791
Just keep your phone on.

107
00:09:29,875 --> 00:09:31,750
Respond when there's intel, you hear me?

108
00:09:32,333 --> 00:09:35,625
Fireworks end each year and such.
Thanking you very much.

109
00:09:35,708 --> 00:09:36,916
Yes, indeed.

110
00:09:38,958 --> 00:09:39,958
-Hey.
-What?

111
00:09:40,041 --> 00:09:41,333
What was your second question?

112
00:09:41,416 --> 00:09:44,291
Oh, what goes after "all around
mountains and waters combined"?

113
00:09:44,375 --> 00:09:45,375
Hey, hey.

114
00:09:45,458 --> 00:09:47,125
You're not so divine, idiot.

115
00:09:47,625 --> 00:09:49,750
SWAMP EEL NOODLES

116
00:09:49,833 --> 00:09:51,958
Hey. What's the occasion for the feast?

117
00:09:52,041 --> 00:09:54,916
My son was the top of the class,
so of course we're celebrating.

118
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:58,375
-That's right.
-Oh, that's great. Well done.

119
00:09:58,458 --> 00:10:00,208
-Thanks.
-It's only midterms.

120
00:10:00,291 --> 00:10:02,041
You make it sound like university.

121
00:10:02,125 --> 00:10:04,166
The gambling joint's been doing so well,

122
00:10:04,250 --> 00:10:06,458
your dad suddenly gave me 300,000.

123
00:10:06,541 --> 00:10:08,458
I wonder where he got that.

124
00:10:08,958 --> 00:10:10,416
I've been lucky lately.

125
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:12,958
And the gambling joints
had so many customers,

126
00:10:13,041 --> 00:10:14,166
I haven't been able to call.

127
00:10:14,250 --> 00:10:17,000
Oh, is that so?
If business is doing that good,

128
00:10:17,083 --> 00:10:19,541
how about you help me
purchase some seafood?

129
00:10:19,625 --> 00:10:21,083
-Dad, what's wrong?
-What?

130
00:10:21,166 --> 00:10:23,416
-Uh, why is your hand shaking?
-Hmm? Is it?

131
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:25,083
Uh, it's work-related.

132
00:10:25,166 --> 00:10:28,458
I shake that cup every day,
and now it's become a reflex.

133
00:10:28,541 --> 00:10:30,791
-It'll settle down.
-This is serious.

134
00:10:30,875 --> 00:10:35,916
You might need to schedule a full checkup.
A client of mine, you know, Old Hsiao,

135
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,416
he went to get a checkup,
didn't think anything of it.

136
00:10:38,500 --> 00:10:40,458
They diagnosed sarcopenia.

137
00:10:40,541 --> 00:10:43,458
Use your brain. Hsiao's over 70 years old.

138
00:10:43,541 --> 00:10:45,916
-Don't compare that goat to me.
-Oh, I'm worried about you.

139
00:10:46,541 --> 00:10:48,250
Hey don't leave those.
We gotta eat them all.

140
00:10:48,333 --> 00:10:49,875
-Uh-huh.
-The rest we can take with us.

141
00:10:49,958 --> 00:10:52,958
You don't need to tell us.
We'll eat these as well. Oh yeah.

142
00:10:53,833 --> 00:10:56,416
You're clever, aren't you?

143
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:57,791
-Hey, you eating?
-Yes.

144
00:10:57,875 --> 00:11:00,875
-You need to stay number one.
-You make it sound like that's easy.

145
00:11:00,958 --> 00:11:04,041
-It's easy for you. You're great.
-No, it's not. I studied for a long time.

146
00:11:04,125 --> 00:11:05,208
You're my son.

147
00:11:05,291 --> 00:11:08,583
Got the powder. Got the pills.

148
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:11,958
Whoa, what the fuck? Where's number four?

149
00:11:12,458 --> 00:11:15,125
I was raided the other day.
It's the best I can do.

150
00:11:25,250 --> 00:11:27,166
I'm gonna need that. Make it up to me.

151
00:11:27,666 --> 00:11:29,375
No problem.

152
00:11:41,708 --> 00:11:42,833
What's up, bro?

153
00:11:43,875 --> 00:11:45,708
Give it to me. Hand it over.

154
00:11:45,791 --> 00:11:46,708
Hurry.

155
00:11:47,208 --> 00:11:48,416
Crazy, man.

156
00:12:06,875 --> 00:12:07,916
Have you found the phone?

157
00:12:09,541 --> 00:12:10,833
How, man?

158
00:12:10,916 --> 00:12:12,291
Want me to call the cops?

159
00:12:13,041 --> 00:12:15,458
No. Why would I want that?

160
00:12:15,541 --> 00:12:18,833
I'm just wondering if there's anything
that can be traced back to me on it.

161
00:12:18,916 --> 00:12:20,625
Really?

162
00:12:21,208 --> 00:12:23,166
I'm in trouble.
All you care about is yourself.

163
00:12:23,250 --> 00:12:24,916
Calm down, man. Hey, calm down.

164
00:12:26,958 --> 00:12:28,541
Hey, we're thick, man.

165
00:12:28,625 --> 00:12:30,458
We're in this together, yeah?

166
00:12:30,541 --> 00:12:32,708
How many years
we've been working together?

167
00:12:32,791 --> 00:12:34,916
I rely on you to get clients.

168
00:12:35,833 --> 00:12:37,041
Don't worry, man.

169
00:12:37,125 --> 00:12:40,333
Things will die down
and it'll all be over, okay?

170
00:12:40,416 --> 00:12:43,458
The leak? Who the fuck cares, man?
They'll see it and forget it.

171
00:12:43,958 --> 00:12:45,375
That woman died.

172
00:12:45,875 --> 00:12:47,916
The sponsors are getting out.

173
00:12:48,416 --> 00:12:50,500
-That's what this is all about.
-It's okay. It's okay.

174
00:12:50,583 --> 00:12:52,625
That woman's death
wasn't your fault, okay?

175
00:12:52,708 --> 00:12:54,916
You video'd it.
You didn't distribute it, okay?

176
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:55,958
And that woman?

177
00:12:56,041 --> 00:12:59,833
Hey, she had such a conscience
blurring her face, huh?

178
00:13:01,208 --> 00:13:02,083
Hey.

179
00:13:03,291 --> 00:13:05,000
Still holding?

180
00:13:05,083 --> 00:13:06,291
Give me some more.

181
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:10,791
You're fucking addicted, bro.

182
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,625
Hey, listen, listen. Hey.

183
00:13:14,416 --> 00:13:16,041
If the cops ask you anything,

184
00:13:16,125 --> 00:13:19,875
remember, I never existed, all right? Hey.

185
00:13:27,250 --> 00:13:29,875
You've been doing this for over ten years,

186
00:13:29,958 --> 00:13:30,916
and every case,

187
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,958
you still handle them personally.

188
00:13:34,458 --> 00:13:35,666
Hmm.

189
00:13:36,166 --> 00:13:37,416
This client,

190
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:40,166
they went to Yeh Yueh Tong
behind our back.

191
00:13:41,166 --> 00:13:42,625
Something's not right.

192
00:13:43,125 --> 00:13:45,708
When you see the client later, watch them.

193
00:13:47,833 --> 00:13:50,458
If Fixer Lunar knew
that you weren't showing up

194
00:13:50,541 --> 00:13:52,541
and instead were sending me,

195
00:13:53,791 --> 00:13:55,875
I'd imagine she'd feel insulted.

196
00:13:56,375 --> 00:14:00,625
In Cheng He, you're the most senior
and hold the highest rank.

197
00:14:01,125 --> 00:14:02,875
Why would she feel insulted?

198
00:14:02,958 --> 00:14:05,833
Besides, you still call her Fixer Lunar.

199
00:14:06,333 --> 00:14:08,208
Is that honor not enough?

200
00:14:08,958 --> 00:14:11,333
It's become a habit after all this time.

201
00:14:11,833 --> 00:14:13,416
It means nothing, really.

202
00:14:14,708 --> 00:14:18,166
It's the same
as when I accidentally address you

203
00:14:18,250 --> 00:14:19,916
as Fixer Solar.

204
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,833
I don't know the rules you two have,

205
00:14:28,916 --> 00:14:31,125
so that's why I hired you both.

206
00:14:31,666 --> 00:14:33,000
It's all right.

207
00:14:34,083 --> 00:14:36,041
I know that you love your daughter.

208
00:14:37,250 --> 00:14:40,000
There is an order to things at all times.

209
00:14:40,916 --> 00:14:42,416
Can I ask, Prosecutor,

210
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:45,416
which side did you hire to begin with?

211
00:14:50,416 --> 00:14:51,750
Ching He.

212
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,375
However,

213
00:14:54,458 --> 00:14:57,625
the first to accept
may not be the best for the job,

214
00:14:58,458 --> 00:15:01,333
be it a case or a new position.

215
00:15:01,916 --> 00:15:03,791
I think you'd agree with that.

216
00:15:04,625 --> 00:15:07,500
The videos those lowlifes
filmed have already gone viral.

217
00:15:07,583 --> 00:15:09,916
I'm worried my daughter's could be next.

218
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:14,583
You said that you'd deal with it
even if it meant killing someone.

219
00:15:15,083 --> 00:15:17,250
I don't care that you're competing.

220
00:15:17,333 --> 00:15:19,541
You received the money, so get it done.

221
00:15:19,625 --> 00:15:22,208
If you have to work together
or whatever, do it.

222
00:15:22,291 --> 00:15:24,250
I just want my daughter to be safe.

223
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:26,541
Please.

224
00:15:30,875 --> 00:15:35,000
Although Yeh Yueh Tong and Ching He
have never worked together before,

225
00:15:35,083 --> 00:15:37,083
if it helps finish the job,

226
00:15:37,833 --> 00:15:39,500
I'm for it this time.

227
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:43,000
The Emperor Tai account belongs
to someone called Cho Wen-tai.

228
00:15:43,583 --> 00:15:45,166
He owns a nightclub called Ash.

229
00:15:47,166 --> 00:15:49,250
I restored a conversation
between him and Sheng.

230
00:15:50,083 --> 00:15:52,541
He's been selling drugs to Sheng
for a long time,

231
00:15:52,625 --> 00:15:55,875
as well as a lot of other celebrities,
but that isn't even the craziest part.

232
00:15:55,958 --> 00:15:58,541
Sheng brings women to the nightclub,
and Cho Wen-tai drugs them.

233
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:02,625
But it's just the tip of the iceberg.
There's definitely more people involved.

234
00:16:28,333 --> 00:16:29,916
We should clarify something.

235
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:32,750
Before this discussion continues,

236
00:16:33,791 --> 00:16:36,208
Ching He Temple just found out

237
00:16:37,250 --> 00:16:39,000
that three years ago, your daughter

238
00:16:39,833 --> 00:16:42,125
was in a vegetative state in hospital.

239
00:16:42,625 --> 00:16:46,125
And so it would be impossible
for her to film a video with Sheng.

240
00:16:47,666 --> 00:16:48,708
Ms. Yen.

241
00:16:49,291 --> 00:16:52,208
What exactly is your motive
for this commission?

242
00:17:01,541 --> 00:17:03,166
You here for Cho Wen-tai?

243
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:05,458
Give it to me now.

244
00:17:06,625 --> 00:17:09,500
You here for this case
or you just want that?

245
00:17:10,875 --> 00:17:11,708
Both.

246
00:17:13,416 --> 00:17:15,041
Next time, ring ahead.

247
00:17:15,125 --> 00:17:17,000
I'd have brought it if you had.

248
00:17:20,083 --> 00:17:22,666
So how are you going to get close
to Cho Wen-tai?

249
00:17:23,166 --> 00:17:24,875
Use the Sheng way again?

250
00:17:27,458 --> 00:17:28,916
Mission cancelled.

251
00:17:42,041 --> 00:17:43,875
SIR HONG: MISSION CANCELED

252
00:17:48,708 --> 00:17:50,416
The commission is cancelled.

253
00:17:50,500 --> 00:17:52,208
-Stand down.
