Yeh Yueh Tong's interfering,

514
00:34:03,875 --> 00:34:05,750
so Ching He has to pay a visit.

515
00:34:06,250 --> 00:34:07,708
Is that it?

516
00:34:10,458 --> 00:34:12,375
Have you come to warn me?

517
00:34:14,166 --> 00:34:15,291
Or to see me?

518
00:34:21,083 --> 00:34:22,625
I came to warn you.

519
00:34:23,166 --> 00:34:24,875
And to see you. That fine?

520
00:34:25,708 --> 00:34:27,625
I told him I was your friend.

521
00:34:27,708 --> 00:34:29,375
And then I was treated as a foe.

522
00:34:30,166 --> 00:34:31,666
I thought I'd just hand back this.

523
00:34:31,750 --> 00:34:32,625
Hand it over now.

524
00:34:36,583 --> 00:34:37,750
Stay out of my way, will you?

525
00:34:37,833 --> 00:34:40,833
There's money for medical expenses.
Don't get up.

526
00:34:41,750 --> 00:34:42,750
Mm, mm.

527
00:34:43,791 --> 00:34:45,916
Fuck!

528
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:48,500
Ching He's discovered your identity.

529
00:34:48,583 --> 00:34:50,708
-If Yeh Yueh Tong finds out…
-That's fine.

530
00:34:50,791 --> 00:34:52,041
It's between me and him.

531
00:34:55,166 --> 00:34:58,208
I think
that you should stop investigating.

532
00:34:58,291 --> 00:35:02,750
If Gerald doesn't ever wanna get found,
no amount of searching will help.

533
00:35:03,750 --> 00:35:04,958
I feel that

534
00:35:05,625 --> 00:35:06,958
I will find him.

535
00:35:11,416 --> 00:35:12,916
I gotta go now.

536
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,458
Already? What's the rush?

537
00:35:14,958 --> 00:35:16,166
Use the ointment.

538
00:35:16,791 --> 00:35:18,916
Young people, for fuck's sake.

539
00:35:19,416 --> 00:35:20,916
What a disaster.

540
00:35:21,458 --> 00:35:24,416
If I wasn't crippled in one leg,
that guy would have been on the floor.

541
00:35:25,875 --> 00:35:29,208
Although, I got some US dollars.

542
00:35:54,291 --> 00:35:56,166
Make a sound and you're dead.

543
00:35:58,583 --> 00:35:59,416
Give me the phone.

544
00:36:09,833 --> 00:36:11,208
I don't wanna kill you.

545
00:36:12,041 --> 00:36:13,666
But that guy, he will.

546
00:36:15,291 --> 00:36:17,000
When I bring the knife down,

547
00:36:17,500 --> 00:36:20,500
you walk away. You saw nothing.

548
00:36:22,666 --> 00:36:23,958
If you talk,

549
00:36:24,041 --> 00:36:27,000
I'll use this phone to track you.

550
00:36:27,958 --> 00:36:29,250
Your family as well.

551
00:36:49,583 --> 00:36:51,541
Thank you.

552
00:36:52,458 --> 00:36:55,000
This time, where do you want the body?

553
00:36:55,083 --> 00:36:57,125
Put it in that woman's room.

554
00:36:57,208 --> 00:37:00,500
When she wakes and sees the body,
she'll spill everything.

555
00:37:00,583 --> 00:37:02,541
Really? Look, I know we're friends,

556
00:37:02,625 --> 00:37:04,750
but this time I'm charging a call-out fee.

557
00:37:04,833 --> 00:37:07,625
My car's turning into
your personal hearse.

558
00:37:08,708 --> 00:37:10,375
Yeh Yueh Tong paying you enough?

559
00:37:10,458 --> 00:37:12,458
Want me to talk to Madam Fan for you?

560
00:37:12,541 --> 00:37:13,791
You get fucked.

561
00:37:13,875 --> 00:37:17,333
-You want me to die, do you?
-Get out of here.

562
00:37:17,416 --> 00:37:18,666
Give me back my phone.

563
00:37:29,708 --> 00:37:31,333
Lower your gun. I'll handle it.

564
00:37:37,541 --> 00:37:39,291
If I go back without it…

565
00:37:39,375 --> 00:37:41,958
…I'll be beaten to death.

566
00:37:53,041 --> 00:37:54,416
How much did you see?

567
00:37:58,083 --> 00:37:59,375
You took it just now,

568
00:37:59,458 --> 00:38:02,541
my phone, and forgot to give it back.
Can I have it?

569
00:38:03,208 --> 00:38:04,833
I didn't see anything.

570
00:38:08,666 --> 00:38:10,291
If I return it,

571
00:38:10,791 --> 00:38:13,250
do you promise
you won't remember anything?

572
00:38:15,875 --> 00:38:19,333
At the corner of the alley,
there was this token and some blood too.

573
00:38:19,416 --> 00:38:21,208
Take care of it.

574
00:38:21,291 --> 00:38:23,750
Hold it high, so I can get a good look.

575
00:38:39,208 --> 00:38:40,208
How old are you?

576
00:38:40,708 --> 00:38:41,541
16.

577
00:38:42,625 --> 00:38:43,625
Mm.

578
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:46,500
What were you doing at 16?

579
00:38:46,583 --> 00:38:47,583
16?

580
00:38:47,666 --> 00:38:49,875
-Remembering 36 is a stretch.
-I want to learn.

581
00:38:51,291 --> 00:38:53,250
Teach me to fire a gun.

582
00:38:54,291 --> 00:38:55,875
Do you know what we do?

583
00:39:02,916 --> 00:39:06,583
You're going to threaten someone…
with a body.

584
00:39:06,666 --> 00:39:08,583
You're telling me you did see something?

585
00:39:09,750 --> 00:39:11,583
If I'm an accessory,

586
00:39:12,458 --> 00:39:14,250
does it matter what I saw?

587
00:39:15,041 --> 00:39:16,041
Get me?

588
00:39:21,708 --> 00:39:24,041
I have to say, this girl's a natural.

589
00:39:27,416 --> 00:39:30,000
Clean up what you saw in the alley.

590
00:39:56,750 --> 00:39:58,083
You talking or not?

591
00:39:59,541 --> 00:40:01,291
Gerald wanted a hand.

592
00:40:01,375 --> 00:40:03,875
But he got a call and left super quick.

593
00:40:04,375 --> 00:40:05,875
Who was it?

594
00:40:05,958 --> 00:40:09,000
The leader of Sun He, Lin Wan-li.

595
00:40:15,625 --> 00:40:16,875
Hello!

596
00:40:16,958 --> 00:40:19,458
Hello, my beautiful wife.
I just bought food.

597
00:40:19,541 --> 00:40:21,041
I'm heading back.

598
00:40:21,125 --> 00:40:22,791
Oh, would you like something?

599
00:40:23,833 --> 00:40:24,875
Okay.

600
00:40:27,083 --> 00:40:28,458
Hey, what the…
